 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reporting",
     "texto": [
      "**Сообщать** (to report) takes **что** + clause: **Журналисты сообщают, что никто не ранен** («Journalists report that nobody was hurt»). In news reports the form **сообщают** («they report») is used a lot without a specific subject.",
      "**Случилось** («happened») is the neuter past of **случиться**: **Что случилось?** («What happened?»). **Никто** means «nobody»; as a subject, it takes the masculine singular **ранен** here: **никто не ранен**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "According to whom",
     "texto": [
      "In **по данным полиции** («according to the police»), **по** governs the plural dative of **данные** (**данным**); the noun that depends on **данные** goes in the genitive (**полиции**). Also: **по данным министерства**.",
      "In **по словам врача** («according to the doctor»), **по** governs the plural dative (**словам**) and **врача** is the genitive of the person quoted. Distinguish the case of **данным/словам** from the case of the noun that completes them."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
